      "primaryType": "coffee_shop",
      "shortFormattedAddress": "Ground Floor, Mary Lodge, 21A, Chapel Rd, Ranwar, Bandra West, Mumbai",
      "reviews": [
        {
          "name": "places/ChIJQ_5UeoXJ5zsR__eCJdbHoiQ/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURweU5IQTZRRRAB",
          "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago",
          "rating": 4,
          "text": {
            "text": "The spot is almost out of reach, on a small street in Bandra, built in a restored two storied Bandra village house, surrounded by similar structures. Very quaint and very charming.\nAs for food and beverages menu, there is plenty to choose from, and most of the dishes on the menu are on display, which is great.\nI loved the rustic bread options used for their toasts and sandwiches, spot on.\nDuring my maiden visit, I ditched usual coffees for a coffee kombucha, and I must say I did the right thing.\nAbout service, our server had some delay with our Beverage order, but they apologized and the quality of the drinks made up for it.\nAs for the ambiance, great vibe, colourful but not overtoned, and charming architecture of the beautiful house shows  throughout. I could spend hours here.\n\nIf all day breakfast/brunch is your goal, then this spot should be on your RADAR.",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "originalText": {
            "text": "The spot is almost out of reach, on a small street in Bandra, built in a restored two storied Bandra village house, surrounded by similar structures. Very quaint and very charming.\nAs for food and beverages menu, there is plenty to choose from, and most of the dishes on the menu are on display, which is great.\nI loved the rustic bread options used for their toasts and sandwiches, spot on.\nDuring my maiden visit, I ditched usual coffees for a coffee kombucha, and I must say I did the right thing.\nAbout service, our server had some delay with our Beverage order, but they apologized and the quality of the drinks made up for it.\nAs for the ambiance, great vibe, colourful but not overtoned, and charming architecture of the beautiful house shows  throughout. I could spend hours here.\n\nIf all day breakfast/brunch is your goal, then this spot should be on your RADAR.",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "authorAttribution": {
            "displayName": "Siddhesh Mhatre",
            "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107559989715286824797/reviews",
            "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVL-d4TaBT25trTWkjr5zutTdPqJ8-7msm9o2MDEwRQG-qw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4"
          },
          "publishTime": "2023-08-15T07:13:23Z"
        },
        {
          "name": "places/ChIJQ_5UeoXJ5zsR__eCJdbHoiQ/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSbE9DWVVnEAE",
          "relativePublishTimeDescription": "9 months ago",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": {
            "text": "This place is like a foodie paradise because all of their food is beautiful and it's on the display at the main counter. After reading reviews I knew I had to try the espresso filled croissant. Normally I don't order coffee desserts but man this one was absolutely delicious. I definitely recommend it! In addition we had the veggie stack sandwich which we also really enjoyed. The honey cappuccino is fantastic if you like sweet coffee and the black coffee is also great.",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "originalText": {
            "text": "This place is like a foodie paradise because all of their food is beautiful and it's on the display at the main counter. After reading reviews I knew I had to try the espresso filled croissant. Normally I don't order coffee desserts but man this one was absolutely delicious. I definitely recommend it! In addition we had the veggie stack sandwich which we also really enjoyed. The honey cappuccino is fantastic if you like sweet coffee and the black coffee is also great.",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "authorAttribution": {
            "displayName": "Amanda Weilenmann",
            "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102003786511517584140/reviews",
            "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsilqXWR5LlK5BxLMKUXMjIxXt_Qt9TY5Zgz0q1FzE7A=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
          },
          "publishTime": "2023-04-18T13:39:16Z"
        },
        {
          "name": "places/ChIJQ_5UeoXJ5zsR__eCJdbHoiQ/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4OHZPLVZ3EAE",
          "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 months ago",
          "rating": 3,
          "text": {
            "text": "Went there after the much hype about the coffee here.\n\nOrdered for iced mocha and it was watery and tasteless.\nThe chocolate croissant was served cold and however the chocolate tasted good\nThe mushroom sandwich was filling but was priced at 595+ taxes\n\nWa single slice of bread with peanut butter spread and bananas was priced at ₹400\nWe ordered two more sandwiches and they were decent\n\nWe paid 3300 for 3 sandwiches and 3 coffees.\n\nThe service is great. The staff very polite.\nAttracts trendy crowd.\nHowever would rate it 3.5/5 for poor quality of food",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "originalText": {
            "text": "Went there after the much hype about the coffee here.\n\nOrdered for iced mocha and it was watery and tasteless.\nThe chocolate croissant was served cold and however the chocolate tasted good\nThe mushroom sandwich was filling but was priced at 595+ taxes\n\nWa single slice of bread with peanut butter spread and bananas was priced at ₹400\nWe ordered two more sandwiches and they were decent\n\nWe paid 3300 for 3 sandwiches and 3 coffees.\n\nThe service is great. The staff very polite.\nAttracts trendy crowd.\nHowever would rate it 3.5/5 for poor quality of food",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "authorAttribution": {
            "displayName": "Amruta D",
            "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109186169721828683066/reviews",
            "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUWmJcgt_x9W6GPktq3AK-5LREUURm4coJ-MmVmqNBse-bl=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
          },
          "publishTime": "2023-06-05T16:09:57Z"
        },
        {
          "name": "places/ChIJQ_5UeoXJ5zsR__eCJdbHoiQ/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURKd09HdXd3RRAB",
          "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 months ago",
          "rating": 5,
          "text": {
            "text": "This place is a heaven for coffee lovers. Almost all the coffee on their menu is worth a try. I am not an avid coffee fan myself but have friends who are and they drag me to this place ever so often! Over time, I must agree I have come to appreciate this place quite immensely.\nCoffee lover or not, this place is a great eatery also. They have amazing croissants, quiche and other items. Highly recommend trying their food! Also, good place to chill like any other coffee joint!",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
          "originalText": {
            "text": "This place is a heaven for coffee lovers. Almost all the coffee on their menu is worth a try. I am not an avid coffee fan myself but have friends who are and they drag me to this place ever so often! Over time, I must agree I have come to appreciate this place quite immensely.\nCoffee lover or not, this place is a great eatery also. They have amazing croissants, quiche and other items. Highly recommend trying their food! Also, good place to chill like any other coffee joint!",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
