        {
          "name": "places/ChIJQ_5UeoXJ5zsR__eCJdbHoiQ/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwc012Y0tBEAE",
          "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago",
          "rating": 1,
          "text": {
            "text": "The entree we ordered had a hair! The coffee literally gave me an upset stomach.\nThe first time we went here, we had loved the Black Forest French toast. But today’s experience was horrible! Usually I avoid giving bad reviews, wouldn’t have even for the hair! But stale milk in coffee is unacceptable! Never expected food poisoning after paying such a hefty amount. Never returning back to this place 🙈",
            "languageCode": "en"
          },
